  "prefLabel": "Ac 102.14 Public Accountancy",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Ac 102.14 “Public Accountancy” means the provision of any service, the undertaking of any function, or the exercise of any privilege for which a certificate, registration, or permit is required pursuant to RSA 309-B.\n\nSource. #10053, eff 1-1-12 (from Ac 101.13); renumbered by #13995 (formerly Ac 102.13)",
